        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: FinOps Lead maintain the value-realization register per investment (business case W4100 → realized), with owners and timelines, integrated with OpEx benefit tracking (VS-133 W4065)
Responsible (R): FinOps Lead / OpEx / Finance
Accountable (A): CIO / CFO
Duration: Per investment</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4113_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4113_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4113_Task5" name="FinOps Lead/Finance track realized value (revenue, cost, productivity, risk)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: FinOps Lead/Finance track realized value (revenue, cost, productivity, risk), reconcile to FP&amp;A (VS-17.4), and attribute adoption-dependent value (VS-134 W4095)
Responsible (R): FinOps Lead / Finance
Accountable (A): FinOps Lead
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4113_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4113_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4113_Task6" name="FinOps Lead report value realization to the executive/Board (VS-36), flag…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: FinOps Lead report value realization to the executive/Board (VS-36), flag shortfalls, and feed lessons into future cases (W4100)
Responsible (R): FinOps Lead
Accountable (A): CIO / CFO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4113_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
