    <bpmn:process id="W_W4114" name="W4114. IT Cost-to-Serve, Unit Cost &amp; Productivity Ratio Analytics" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: TBM maturity; quarterly analytics
Frequency: Continuous + quarterly
Volume: Enterprise technology (cost-per-transaction, cost-per-store, cost-per-order, IT-spend-%-revenue)
Owner: FinOps Lead / BI (VS-28)
Participants: BI (VS-28), Finance (VS-17.4), CIO office
Source: workflow W4114 — IT Cost-to-Serve, Unit Cost &amp; Productivity Ratio Analytics</bpmn:documentation>
