      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4114_Task4" name="FinOps Lead/BI define and compute unit economics: IT-spend-%-revenue…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: FinOps Lead/BI define and compute unit economics: IT-spend-%-revenue, cost-per-POS-transaction, cost-per-ecommerce-order, cost-per-store, cost-per-employee, productivity ratios
Responsible (R): FinOps Lead / BI
Accountable (A): CIO / CFO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4114_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4114_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4114_Task5" name="FinOps Lead/BI benchmark unit costs internally (trend, by entity) and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: FinOps Lead/BI benchmark unit costs internally (trend, by entity) and externally, identify outliers/improvement targets
Responsible (R): FinOps Lead / BI
Accountable (A): FinOps Lead
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4114_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4114_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4114_Task6" name="FinOps Lead report unit economics to leadership, drive cost-to-serve reduction…">
