Responsible (R): FinOps Lead / Treasury
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4119_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4119_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
